    url: https://github.com/owid/co2-data
    description: "owid-co2-data.csv: territorial CO2 from fossil fuels and industry
      by fuel (coal, oil, gas, flaring, cement, other industry), land-use change CO2
      for the world, and population, from the Global Carbon Budget 2025 and OWID's
      population series. Retrieved 2026-11-23 by scripts/fetch_owid_co2.py; the subset
      used (every country and the EU 1990-2024, the world 1850-2024) is inputs/owid_co2.csv.
      Blank fuel components where the total exists are zero: the components sum to
      the total in every row.; Attachment: inputs/owid_co2.csv; Format: .csv; Licensing:
      CC BY 4.0; Geographic Coverage: World and countries (present borders); Date
      Last Updated: 2026-11-23; Updated by: Kausal"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  index_columns:
  - Year
  - co2_source
  updated_at: '1795431445'
  units:
